      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t02_09",
      "hash64": "B8FB8FABB6AECF85",
      "text": "¡Por fin me ha llegado el Antiparalizador!\\nSirve para curar la parálisis de un Pokémon.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "t02_10",
      "hash64": "B8FEFCABB6B1BE93",
      "text": "El Pokémon a la cabeza de tu equipo es el que\\nsaldrá a luchar al inicio de cualquier combate.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "t02_11",
      "hash64": "B8FEFBABB6B1BCE0",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "t02_12",
      "hash64": "B8FEFEABB6B1C1F9",
      "text": "Tú debes de ser estudiante... ¿no? El uniforme\\nte ha delatado.\\c\\n¿Sabías que puedes llevar encima hasta seis\\nPokémon? ¡No pierdes nada por hacerlo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "t02_13",
      "hash64": "B8FEFDABB6B1C046",
      "text": "¡Estoy estudiando a los Pokémon en la academia!\\c\\nEl otro día aprendí que pueden conocer hasta\\ncuatro movimientos a la vez.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "t02_14",
      "hash64": "B8FF00ABB6B1C55F",
      "text": "Los alumnos de Pueblo Ataifor no vivimos en\\nla residencia, así que tenemos que tragarnos la\\r\\ncuesta que lleva a la academia todos los días...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "t02_15",
      "hash64": "B8FEFFABB6B1C3AC",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "t02_17",
      "hash64": "B8FF01ABB6B1C712",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "t02_21",
      "hash64": "B8F48BABB6A8AA0B",
      "text": "¡Pelipper se mete en el pico las cartas y paquetes\\npara repartirlos!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "t02_22",
      "hash64": "B8F48CABB6A8ABBE",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "t02_23",
      "hash64": "B8F48DABB6A8AD71",
      "text": "Ve con cuidado, anda. ¡Y no te olvides de\\nguardar con frecuencia!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "t02_24",
      "hash64": "B8F48EABB6A8AF24",
      "text": "Este es Pueblo Ataifor, un pueblecito tranquilito\\ny de confort.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
